>> title: Flourless Chocolate Cake
>> category: Cakes & Loaves
>> tags: chocolate, gluten free, dessert, oven
>> servings: 10
>> time: 1 hr 30 min
>> step.5: whisk in one at a time

Butter an #8-in springform pan{} and line the bottom with parchment.

Preheat the #oven{} to 325°F (165°C).

Melt @bittersweet chocolate{8%oz}(225 g; chopped), @unsalted butter{1/2%cup}(115 g) over a water bath.

Whisk @granulated sugar{3/4%cup}(150 g), @unsweetened cocoa powder{1/4%cup}(25 g), @espresso powder{1/2%tsp}(1 g), @table salt{1/4%tsp}(1.5 g), @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL) into @&(~1)melted chocolate{}.

Whisk @eggs{4%large} into @&(~1)chocolate mixture{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 325°F for ~{35%min}, then cool in the pan.
